// Rule: [T1218.011] Clickfix Pcalua RUNDLL32 - Clickfix Multi Stage Execution
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1218.011
// Classification: Production candidate
// Status: Production candidate - environment validation required
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR / Microsoft Sentinel with MDE tables
// Required telemetry: DeviceProcessEvents
// Purpose: Hidden WMI process creation, remote WebDAV access and Rundll32 proxy execution.
// Logic: Evaluate DeviceProcessEvents for clickfix multi stage execution using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: A match indicates that one process event retained the high-signal combination of pcalua, PowerShell/WMI hidden-process syntax, rundll32 and remote-path notation.
// A match does not prove: ATT&CK: T1202, T1047, T1218.011, T1059.001 Important: This behavior is compatible with an observed ClickFix incident, but the match alone does not prove the initial lure or actor attribution.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// Title: ClickFix Multi-Stage Execution via Pcalua, WMI and Rundll32
// Status: Production candidate - environment validation required
// Confidence: High
// Platform: Microsoft Defender XDR / Microsoft Sentinel with MDE tables
// Telemetry: DeviceProcessEvents
// Purpose: Detect a highly specific chain in which pcalua proxies PowerShell,
// PowerShell uses WMI to create a hidden process, and rundll32 is instructed
// to execute content from a remote path.
// ATT&CK: T1202, T1047, T1218.011, T1059.001
// Important: This behavior is compatible with an observed ClickFix incident,
// but the match alone does not prove the initial lure or actor attribution.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where Timestamp >= ago(1h)
| where FileName =~ "pcalua.exe"
| where ProcessCommandLine has "powershell"
| where ProcessCommandLine contains "Win32_Process"
| where ProcessCommandLine contains "ShowWindow=0"
| where ProcessCommandLine has "rundll32"
| where ProcessCommandLine contains @"\\"
    or ProcessCommandLine contains @"@SSL\"
| project Timestamp, DeviceId, DeviceName, AccountName,
          ProcessCommandLine, InitiatingProcessFileName,
          InitiatingProcessCommandLine, SHA1, ReportId
